      "quote": "河東王譽字重孫，昭明太子第二子也。",
      "note": "河東郡王爵號。",
      "chapter_id": "c-liangshu-055-hedong-wangyu-parent",
      "book_id": "b-liangshu-055",
      "work_id": "w-liangshu",
